<h1>About this project</h1>
<p class="lead">firstASPnet is a personal ASP.NET Core MVC learning project maintained by <a href="https://github.com/omarhussainfahmi" rel="noopener noreferrer">omarhussainfahmi</a>.</p>
<h2>What you can explore</h2><p>The public pages demonstrate Razor layouts, accessible navigation, page metadata, error handling, and form validation. The source also contains exercises for entities, service contracts, repositories, JWT generation, and custom filters.</p>
<h2>Project status</h2><p>This is a learning sample. The original person-management, product, export, and database exercises are incomplete and are not available through the public site. A production application needs completed authorization, persistence, and business logic before enabling those features.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/omarhussainfahmi/ASP.NET-project-Full-dummy-sample-" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the source on GitHub</a></p>
